  "vulnerability_information": "**Description:**\nAuthenticated users have access to User and Session Analytics for the platform. \n\n## References\n\n## Impact\n\nAllows a user to see active boards, total candidates, vote rate and estimated completion in the last 12 days by default.\n\n## System Host(s)\n███,████████\n\n## Affected Product(s) and Version(s)\n1.09.00.000\n\n## CVE Numbers\n\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\nLogin and Authenticate to ████████\n\nWhere the logged in user name is in the top left, select the name, then select My Boards (active boards). \n\nOnce that page loads, theres a link 'Home' that when clicks takes you to https█████\n\n## Suggested Mitigation/Remediation Actions\nEither block access to less permission users from seeing the dashboard, or remove it.\n\n",
